          "category": "other",
          "title": "Justification",
          "text": "The vulnerability requires a Session object to be reused across requests with verify=False after a prior verified request. Every outbound call in services/kb uses a fresh httpx.AsyncClient with verification enabled and never sets verify=False, so the affected code path is unreachable in this product."
